{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去日本旅行想留盡行李位掃戰利品，又腳痕想跑返轉？跑步愛好者 Tama 實測位於皇居附近的跑站Raffine Neo Running Style，無需自備任何裝備，兩手空空都可以輕鬆開跑。\n</p>\n<p>跑站提供跑衫、跑褲及跑鞋租用，跑完覺得適合先決定入手，唔怕單靠店內試穿而買錯鞋。</p>\n<p>皇居外圍一圈約 5 公里，平坦而且距離好計，沿途亦有不少當地跑友一齊跑，氣氛熱血。站內可以寄存背囊，跑完仲可以直接沖涼及補充運動飲品，乾乾爽爽繼續去 Shopping。</p>\n<p>📍地址：東京都千代田區內幸町1-1-1 帝國酒店塔樓 B1F（Raffine Running Style Neo）</p>\n<p>好動旅人 ｜ 旅遊不止食買玩，用跑步、潛水或滑雪等活動探索世界，在運動的節奏裡，發現每個地方最真實的風景。邊一場戶外旅程令你最難忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的冒險故事！\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463608628230863_2795497336af7f9374da62.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463608628230863_2795497336af7f9374da62.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@tama.isme)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DftTGd-vIKh/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%97%85%e8%b7%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅跑</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e8%b7%91%e6%ad%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京跑步</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9a%87%e5%b1%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">皇居</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@tama.isme資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DftTGd-vIKh/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 14 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:20:50.352124+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":508,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:15.982287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:15.982287+00:00","content_hash":"5130d680f287c543d285c15ae5773fd83228039a5183859fea172b101b478ace","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}